{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"gantry-2","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Controller\n\n==🟡ETA: 1st of November==\n\n- exposable parameters for software control\n- input filters to smooth and tune movement \n- fixed stable movement range and calibration to fix coordinates across run to isolate for model","x":-480,"y":-573,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"gantry-3","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Camera + calibration\n- map camera view to gantry movement plane \n- calibration to help with camera placement sensitivity","x":-480,"y":-202,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"gantry-4","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Supervised bring-up\nTest unloaded motion, then an owned phone.\nRequire hardware, calibration and safety checks before physical contact.","x":-480,"y":170,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"gantry-1","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Build the gantry\n==🟡ETA: 28th of October==\n\nBaseplate [arrirving soon,], \n\nelectronics [arriving soon], \n\nwebcam [need to order]\n- try and find one at work\n\nphone [need to order]\n- find one on facebook, anything that runs safari works for now\n\n3D print parts [not started]\n- need to design parts, get files and print at work","x":-480,"y":-960,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"integration","type":"text","text":"## 5 · Connect vision to gantry\n- map gantry webcam movement to phone borders and map to vision model borders \n- run rl calibration and optimization with phone serving site \n- store blue team data and try to spot compared to human users, go back to the drawing board where needed ","x":-480,"y":640,"width":1000,"height":280},
