		{"id":"vision-3","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Train detector + OCR pipeline\n- create loop setup to train","x":600,"y":-202,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"vision-2","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Label + split\n- deteministically label all synthetic data on creation \n- define loss function and objectives for ocr model","x":600,"y":-573,"width":1000,"height":290},
		{"id":"vision-1","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Build tasks + capture data\n- create site to serve\n- expose all red team needed params and store all of blue team info\n- make layout and graph shuffle and bank of icons and pages and layouts to serve synthetic data ","x":600,"y":-956,"width":1000,"height":293},
		{"id":"vision-4","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Evaluate + export\n- Measure target hits, OCR errors and latency.\n- Compare exported outputs; reserve unseen real-phone data for final validation.\n- quantize and prune model and reiterate on new datasets and refine loss function and bias untill fast and accurate","x":600,"y":170,"width":1000,"height":293},
